;; Samus's training stage (0.4.37, src/game/tutorial/heroes/samus.ts; docs/HEROES.md), in the
;; Brinstar look: the short beam at an enemy (gate 16), aiming up at a target hanging from the
;; ceiling (gate 27), the morph ball through the tunnel and a bomb jump up the step inside it, the
;; Energy Tank, the Long Beam across the ditch (gate 60), Missiles to open the wall's brick, the Ice
;; Beam's freeze and shatter on an enemy out of a pipe (gate 82), the Varia Suit's half-cost hit from
;; another (gate 94), the Wave Beam through
;; the closed wall (gate 109) and the flagpole. Each power block's item is in [hero-items]; the
;; gates are laid by the tutorial.
